      "id": "V1URs4",
      "x": -1219,
      "y": 117,
      "width": 583,
      "height": 594,
      "content": "For breadcrumbs, the current page should be visually active.\n\nExample: Settings | Profile\n- When the user is on the Profile page:\n- Profile is active and uses the default dark text color\n- Settings is inactive and uses 60% opacity\n\nOn hover:\n- Settings should become fully visible, 100% opacity, to show it is clickable\n\nOn click:\n- Navigate back to the Settings menu\n- Remove Profile from the breadcrumb\n- Settings becomes the active item with the default dark text color"
    },
